  "caption": "380 Appendix Fig 5. (A) Bioluminescence analysis of fibrotic mice induced by CCL4 at 0, 0.5, 2, 8, 381 24, and 72 hours post-intravenous injection of 40 μg of luciferase mRNA encapsulated in LNP 382 (LNP-Luc and αCD163/LNP-Luc). (B) The luciferase activity of major organs at 8 and 72 hours. 383 (C-D) IF images depicting ZsGreen expression in CCL4-induced fibrotic mice post-intravenous 384 injection of 40 μg of ZsGreen mRNA encapsulated in LNP-ZsGreen and αCD163/LNP-ZsGreen 385 groups at different times, and the statistical analysis. (E) The mRNA levels in serum over time. (F) 386 A schematic representation of in vivo delivery experiments. (G) IF co-localization images 387 demonstrating the localization of CD163 (red) and ZsGreen in the fibrotic mouse liver (scale 388 bar=20 μm). (H-J) Flow cytometry analysis of ZsGreen and CD163 expression in the screened 389 macrophages and the analysis. (K-L) IF images depicting the co-staining with markers for liver 390 cells (ALB+), HSCs (Desmin+), macrophages (F4/80+), bile duct cells (SOX9+), and the statistical 391 analysis. (scale bar=20 μm). (n=3). (M-N) IF staining of FAPCAR (red) in liver tissues, 392 highlighting F4/80+ (green) macrophages (scale bar=10 μm) and the statistical analysis. (n=6). (O) 393 The triple IF staining of liver tissue sections using Desmin+ (white), F4/80+ (green), and 394 FAPCAR+ (red) (scale bar=20 μm). (n=3). Differences among groups were statistically evaluated 395 using one-way ANOVA. Significance was indicated as *P < 0.01 and non-significance as ns P > 396 0.05. 397 398",
